      <li><a href="#ch-fa-discover">12. Discovery Framework</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ch-fa-finance">13. Finance & Risk</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ch-fa-ops">14. Operations & Supply Chain</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ch-fa-mkt">15. Marketing & CX</a></li>
