      <li><a href="#ch12">21. L3 · B2B Practice-Wide</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ch13">22. L4 · B2C Transformation</a></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="part-title">Part VI · Plays</div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#ch14">23. The 10-Minute Pitch</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ch15">24. Objections & Recoveries</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ch16">25. BVA in 5 Bullets</a></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="part-title">Appendices</div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#appA">A. Edition × Practice Map</a></li>
      <li><a href="#appB">B. Independence Cheat Sheet</a></li>
      <li><a href="#appC">C. One-Page Pitch Template</a></li>
    </ul>
