      <div class="callout keyplay">
        <div class="callout-label">Key Play</div>
        Every level ends with a single sentence to the practice leader that
        unlocks the next. Memorize the four transitions — they are how the
        ladder climbs itself.
      </div>

      <div class="callout attach">
        <div class="callout-label">The Substrate Under All Four Levels</div>
        Every level above runs on top of the <strong>GSSC Lab</strong> — a
        pre-built Microsoft-native environment with Agent 365, the
        Scenario Matcher, and per-practice service bundles already live.
        That is what lets L1 ship in 5 days and Wave 1 ship in 30. See
        <a href="#ch-gccs">Part II</a>.
