    <section class="part-opener" id="part1">
      <div class="part-label">Part I</div>
      <h1 class="part-title">The Ground Rules</h1>
      <p class="part-intro">
        Three Cliff Notes chapters. If you only read three pages in this
        book, read these. Everything else assumes you know what you are
