              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Capture industry · scale · top pain in the Matcher</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Run a dry pass — confirm scenarios return cleanly</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Note Microsoft attach SKUs for the demo narrative</span></label></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details></li>
        <li><details>
