              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Send the Lab URL within 24 hours of the meeting</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Set viewer-only access for the leader (Independence)</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Include a one-paragraph "what you're seeing" note</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Offer a follow-up walk-through with their tech contact</span></label></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details></li>
        <li><details>
          <summary><strong>Promote to client tenant at L2.</strong> "We built in here; we promote into your tenant for Wave 1."</summary>
          <div class="subtasks">
