        <li>"Promo ROI is opaque — we run the same calendar every year."</li>
        <li>"Margin erosion in Q3 caught us by surprise."</li>
        <li>"Reps spend 40% of their time on admin, not selling."</li>
        <li>"New SKUs take 9 months to reach the floor."</li>
