          <tr><td>Goal</td><td>One agent. One use case. One HITL gate. ROI proven in writing.</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3>Seller Steps</h3>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><details>
          <summary><strong>Choose top 3 accounts</strong> with the practice — not for them.</summary>
          <div class="subtasks">
            <div class="subtasks-label">Sub-tasks</div>
