              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Pre-share the APEX edition agent catalog</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Bring the GSSC Lab tablet for a live Scenario Matcher demo</span></label></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details></li>
        <li><details>
          <summary><strong>Frame Wave 1:</strong> 1 use case · 1 agent · 1 HITL gate · 90 days.</summary>
          <div class="subtasks">
            <div class="subtasks-label">Sub-tasks</div>
            <ul>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Run the functional-area discovery framework (Ch 12)</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Match top 3 scenarios via the GSSC Lab Scenario Matcher</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Pick the highest-blast-radius / lowest-PII candidate</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Confirm HITL gate type (HITL · ACK_ONLY · ZERO_TOUCH · ESCALATION)</span></label></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details></li>
        <li><details>
          <summary><strong>Run a BVA</strong> on the highest-value account. Use the APEX BVA Excel framework.</summary>
          <div class="subtasks">
            <div class="subtasks-label">Sub-tasks</div>
            <ul>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Today's cost + Tomorrow's cost models populated</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Decision-velocity delta calculated</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Error-reduction estimate documented</span></label></li>
