              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Client sign-off on the BVA summary</span></label></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details></li>
        <li><details>
          <summary><strong>Position the Microsoft attach</strong> as the five-platform triad: Fabric (truth), Foundry (brain), Copilot (face), Purview (trust), Entra (identity).</summary>
          <div class="subtasks">
            <div class="subtasks-label">Sub-tasks</div>
            <ul>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Fabric F-SKU sizing model</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Foundry workspace mapping</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Copilot Studio surface design</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Purview labels + DLP plan</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Entra workload identity allocated per agent</span></label></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details></li>
        <li><details>
          <summary><strong>Two contracts, always.</strong> Microsoft licensing direct to client; Deloitte services SOW separate.</summary>
          <div class="subtasks">
            <div class="subtasks-label">Sub-tasks</div>
            <ul>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Microsoft seller introduction completed</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Client procurement aware of the dual-contract structure</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Deloitte SOW shape pulled from the Practice Service Bundle catalog</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Independence review sign-off — no commingling</span></label></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details></li>
        <li><details>
          <summary><strong>Deploy with APEX accelerators.</strong> Semantic models, agent catalog, MCP library, audit-row discipline.</summary>
          <div class="subtasks">
            <div class="subtasks-label">Sub-tasks</div>
