              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>GSSC Lab → client tenant promotion checklist run</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Semantic model installed</span></label></li>
              <li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Agent catalog deployed</span></label></li>
